        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">DN 800, profile 4, SN 10000-20000, according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. GFRP pipe, ID 770-798 mm, outer diameter 821 mm, wall thickness 11-21 mm, 46-87 kg/m, 1650 kg/m³.\n\n# Included processes\nThis process models deconstruction and end-of-life treatment for 1 meter of installed sewer infrastructure with GFRP (glass fibre reinforced plastic) pipe. SN 10000-20000, DN 800, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for 1 meter of sewer system with GFRP pipe, DN 800, profile 4. The operation of similar types of building machines across different processes is aggregated to one process.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
